{"title":"2014 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An airplane holds a maximum of 245 passengers. To accommodate the extra expense of transporting luggage, passengers are charged a baggage fee of \\$20 for the first bag checked plus \\$7 for each additional bag checked. (Passengers who do not check a bag are not charged a baggage fee.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On one flight, 200 passengers checked exactly one bag and the other 45 passengers checked exactly two bags. Determine the total of the baggage fees for checked bags.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> of the passengers checked exactly one bag, they had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for the additional fee and had to pay for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> for each passenger. This means that the passengers that checked exactly one bag paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/24608f5f9165bf795eb03254ca62f3ed2cd4b101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$200 \\times 20 = \\$4000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>For the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> passengers that checked two bags, they had to pay <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars for the additional fee so they had to pay <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/e/63e3b9f73bb5e7124f9e0b7e1800cd0aeb09d221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20 + \\$7 = \\$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" /> for each passenger. This means that the passengers that checked exactly two bags paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a66a093edaf4de94d6e0a2330d6fc96dd9a23ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$27 \\times 45 = \\$1215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"17\" /> in total.\n</p><p>Thus, the total baggage fees for both groups of passengers was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b9d8a67666079a7df576bc252e6b809d98c623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4000 + \\$1215 = \\boxed{\\$5215}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234433\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 363/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1641/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.944      1 2014_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.944      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35631:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234433 and revision id 278075. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}